 legislative, research, and strategic dimensions of an issue. We keep a constant watch of children\'s health issues in all states and store laws and pending or recently defeated bills on pediatric advocacy issues.','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(51,'American Bird Conservancy',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:25:\"American Bird Conservancy\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(52,'American Boiler Manufacturers Association',41,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:41:\"American Boiler Manufacturers Association\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(53,'American Cancer Society',23,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:23:\"American Cancer Society\";}','Org','','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(54,'American Chemistry Council',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:16:\"Amer Che Council\";}','Org','','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(55,'American College of Occupational and Environmental Medicine',59,NULL,'a:2:{i:0;s:57:\"American College of Occupational & Environmental Medicine\";i:1;s:56:\"American Colege of Occupational & Environmental Medicine\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(56,'American Commercial Barge Line Company',38,NULL,'a:4:{i:0;s:38:\"American Commercial Barge Line Company\";i:1;s:34:\"American Commerical Barge Lines Co\";i:2;s:30:\"American Commercial Barge Line\";i:3;s:38:\"American Commerical Barge Line Company\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(57,'American Council of Independent Laboratories',44,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:4:\"ACIL\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(58,'American Crop Protection Association',36,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:30:\"American Crop Protection Assn.\";}','Org',