ional emphasis, preparing them for a global future.\r\n\r\nServing the San Diego region has always been a core part of SDSUâs mission. Founded March 13, 1897, San Diego State University began as the San Diego Normal School, a training facility for elementary school teachers. Seven faculty and 91 students met in temporary quarters over a downtown drugstore before moving to a newly constructed 17-acre campus on Park Boulevard.','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(932,'San Francisco Regional Water Quality Control Board',50,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:50:\"San Francisco Regional Water Quality Control Board\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(933,'San Jose Community Awareness Council Inc.',41,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:41:\"San Jose Community Awareness Council Inc.\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(934,'Santa Barbara Water Company',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:16:\"SB Water Company\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(935,'Santa Clara County (CA)',23,NULL,'a:3:{i:0;s:47:\"Santa Clara County Pollution Prevention Program\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:23:\"Santa Clara County (CA)\";}','Org',NULL,'Org,GovernmentEntity,County',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(936,'Scarola Ellis LLP',17,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:17:\"Scarola Ellis LLP\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(937,'Science Applications International Corporation',46,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:46:\"Science Applications International Corporation\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(938,'Science Network International Inc.',34,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:34:\"Science Network International Inc.\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active'