king Cancer HistoryÂ®, The University of Texas M. D. Anderson Cancer Center is located in central Houston on the sprawling campus of the Texas Medical Center. It is one of the worldâs most-respected centers devoted exclusively to cancer patient care, research, education and prevention.\r\n\r\nM. D. Anderson Cancer Center was created in 1941 as a component of The University of Texas System. The institution is one of the nationâs original three comprehensive cancer centers designated by the National Cancer Act of 1971 and is one of 40 National Cancer Institute-designated comprehensive cancer centers today.\r\n\r\nIn 2009, U.S. News & World Reportâs âAmericaâs Best Hospitalsâ survey ranked\r\nM. D. Anderson as the top hospital in the nation for cancer care. M. D. Anderson has achieved the top ranking six times in the past eight years and has ranked as one of the top two hospitals for cancer care for 20 years, since the magazine began its annual survey in 1990.','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1201,'University of Texas Southwestern Medical Center',47,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:47:\"Univeristy of Texas Southwestern Medical Center\";}','Org','Part of The University of Texas System, UT Southwestern is governed by the UT Board of Regents. President Dr. Daniel K. Podolsky leads the medical center which includes three degree-granting institutions:\r\nUT Southwestern Medical School, UT Southwestern Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences and UT Southwestern School of Health Professions. These three schools train nearly 4,400 medical, graduate and health professions students, residents and postdoctoral fellows each year.\r\n\r\nIn 1943 Southwestern Medical Foundation established Southwestern Medical College. Since donating the school to the UT System in 1949, the Foundation has remained dedicated to supporting UT Southwestern and its affiliated institutions, playing an important role in its growth as one of the nation\'s leading biomedical centers.','Org,School,University',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1202,'University of the Incarnate Word',32,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:32:\"University of the Incarnate Word\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1203,'University of Toronto',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:21:\"University of Toronto\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1204,'University of Utah',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"Unviersity of Utah\";}','Org','','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1205,'University of Virginia',22,NULL,'a:4:{i:0;s:22:\"University of Virginia\";i:1;s:14:\"U. of Virginia\";i:2;s:10:\"Univ of VA\";i:3;s:16:\"University of VA\";}','Org','','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1206,'University of Washington',24,NULL,'a:3:{i:0;s:24:\"University of Washington\";i:1;s:16:\"U. of Washington\";i:2;s:18:\"Univ of Washington\";}','Org','','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1207,'University of Wisconsin',23,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:31:\"University of Wisconsin Madison\";}','Org','','',0,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1208,'UPS',3,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:13:\"UPS Worldwide\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1209,'Urban League of Portland',24,NULL,'a:2:{i:0;s:23:\"Urban Leage of Portland\";i:1;s:24:\"Urban League of Portland\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1210,'US Apple Association',20,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:20:\"US Apple Association\";}','Org',NULL,'',NULL,'2010-10-05 15:14:00','2011-05-25 20:50:43',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(1211,'US Fish & Wildlife Service',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:26:\"US Fish & Wildlife Service\";}','Org','','',0,'2