 an entrepreneurial excitement that remains strong today. This energy is a fundamental quality in all of our attorneys, who make it their mission to understand the visions of our clients as we help them capitalize on opportunities and build for the future. Adept at handling complex, cutting-edge legal and business matters, we take pride in our ability to provide practical solutions to meet each clientâs objectives.\r\n\r\nOur clients range from start-up and emerging growth businesses, to nationally and internationally prominent institutions, including Fortune 500 companies. We also assist municipalities and non-profit organizations. This strong mix of industry, size and focus provides continuing opportunities to hone and strengthen a dynamic foundation of business insight and perspective.\r\n\r\nPart of the global business community and guided by a true spirit of collaboration, we understand that optimal results are driven by a team approach to service. And, every day, we deliver the benefits of this thinking. Itâs our passionate commitment â to our clients, our communities and to ourselves.','Org,Business,LobbyingFirm,LawFirm',0,'2010-10-14 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(4319,'Rlf3 Consulting',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-14 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(4320,'Valis & Keelen LLC (Formerly Valis Associates)',46,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-14 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(4321,'Lilley Justin W',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-14 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(4322,'Miller Assoc Denny',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-14 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(4323,'Turetsky David LLC',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Or