property we manage.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to continuing to meet the challenges we set with the single principle that guides each Habitat employee and has become an integral part of each endeavorâ\"Management Makes The Difference.\"','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5732,'Washington for Senate',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5733,'Friends of Max Baucus',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5734,'Carper for Senate',17,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5735,'Texans for Senator John Cornyn Inc',34,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5736,'Team Sununu',11,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5737,'Hutchinson for Senate',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5738,'Louie Gohmert for Congress Committee',36,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5739,'Bush for President Inc.',23,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(5740,'New Republican Majority Fund',28