LL),(9531,'Revolution Money',16,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Founded in 2005, we use our proprietary processing technology platform and integrated payment card network to bring value to consumers, merchants and issuers, which challenges the traditional payments industry model and aligns the interests of all of the participants.\r\n\r\nBased in St. Petersburg, FL, Revolution Money is part of the family of companies within Revolution LLC, which was founded by Steve Case to drive transformative change by shifting power to consumers. Revolution LLC\'s mission is to give people more choice, more control, and more convenience in the important aspects of their livesâand build significant companies in the process. To find out more about Revolution LLC visit their website at www.revolution.com.\r\n\r\nA New Business Model\r\n\r\nRevolution Money has developed an innovative payment processing platform and has integrated it with a low-cost payment card network that enables a wide variety of payment products to meet the needs of issuers, merchants, and consumers. Our marketing programs with merchants create incentives and offers that encourage consumers to apply for and use RevolutionCard branded credit card and stored value card products issued by our bank partners. Merchants and banks can also use our proprietary technology platform to create their own payment solutions that bridge the online and physical payment experiences.','Org,Business',76,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9532,'Greenwich Associates',20,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9533,'Trujillo Rodriguez & Richards',29,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9534,'Wilson Sonsini Goodrich & Rosati',32,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03