ove health. The Institute provides unbiased, evidence-based, and authoritative information and advice concerning health and science policy to policy-makers, professionals, leaders in every sector of society, and the public at large. more information on the IOM\n\nThe Institute provides a vital service by working outside the framework of government to ensure scientifically informed analysis and independent guidance. The IOM\'s mission is to serve as adviser to the nation to improve health. The Institute provides unbiased, evidence-based, and authoritative information and advice concerning health and science policy to policy-makers, professionals, leaders in every sector of society, and the public at large.','Org,MembershipOrg,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9838,'Hastings Center',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9839,'Science, Tech, Space, and Arts Agency Review Team',49,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:67:\"Obama Transition  Science, Tech, Space, and Arts Agency Review Team\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',33161,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9840,'American International Automobile Dealers Association',53,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9841,'National Volvo Dealer Council',29,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9842,'Joint Center for Political and Economic Studies',47,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit,ThinkTank',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9843,'National Space Society',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9844,'Benton Foundation