nt firm established on 4 November 2005. eBay founder and social entrepreneur Pierre Omidyar and his wife Pam donated $100 million to their alma mater Tufts University to create the fund, which will offer millions of tiny loans to entrepreneurs in developing countries.','Org,Philanthropy,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10358,'Florida 2000',12,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,OtherCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10359,'Cobb/Lamarche',13,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10360,'Independent State Political Action Committee',44,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,OtherCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10361,'Rigdon for Congress',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10362,'O\'Melveny & Myers Political Action Committee',44,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,OtherCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10363,'Conservative & Republican Together Equals Results PAC',53,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,OtherCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10364,'Locke Lord Bissell & Liddell LLP PAC',36,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,OtherCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10365,'Committee to Elect Philip Johnston for Congress',47,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0