ricans to work with NGOs in India for a ten month period. The fellowship helps exchange technical skills, intellectual resources and helps increase the capacity of Indian NGOs to continue their work while giving American leaders a good understanding of India.','Org,Philanthropy,MembershipOrg,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10871,'University of San Francisco',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:26:\"University of San Fransico\";}','Org','','rg,School',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-04-22 00:30:39',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10872,'Skip Rhodes and Associates',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10873,'The Buck Foundation',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Philanthropy',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10874,'Eos Airlines',12,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10875,'ESL Investments',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10876,'Taconic Capital Management',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:26:\"Taconic Capital Management\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10877,'Princeton University Investment Company',39,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:6:\"PRINCO\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10878,'Och-Ziff Capital Management',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10879,'Berkshire Partners',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10880,'Denison University',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','O