 in the Des Moines, Iowa, area and Worldâs offices in Omaha, Nebraska, American Enterprise employs more than 1,100 people.\r\n\r\nMore than 15,000 career and independent agents sell our products. The companies of American Enterprise are licensed in 49 states. To better serve our market, weâre forming business partnerships that will expand our offerings to residents of all 50 states.\r\n\r\nWe protect the personal information you share with us through our comprehensive privacy policy. In addition, we have a business continuity plan that helps us respond to emergencies and disasters so that we can continue to meet your needs.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10929,'Sterling Life Insurance Company',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10930,'ConnectiCare',12,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10931,'United Teacher Associates Insurance Company',43,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10932,'Rocky Mountain Health Plans',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10933,'The Lifetime Healthcare Companies',33,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10934,'Harvard Pilgrim Health Care',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10935,'Blue Cross Blue Shield of Florida',33,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10936,'The Guardian Life Insurance Company of America',46,NULL,'a:1:{