00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11194,'Design Trust for Public Space',29,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Design Trust projects bring together neighborhoods, public agencies, and design professionals to find innovative opportunities for change, making the city more beautiful, sustainable, functional, and available to all. Since our founding in 1995, the Design Trust has completed over 25 projects in all five boroughs, serving and engaging a diverse set of communities.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11195,'NXIVM',5,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Pronounced \"Nexium.\"','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11196,'New York Common Retirement Fund',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:37:\"New York State Common Retirement Fund\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11197,'Democratic Party of Erie County',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:31:\"Democratic Party of Erie County\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalParty,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11198,'Washington College',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,School',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11199,'Citizens for Fiscal Integrity',29,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Pigeon-controlled PAC','Org,Pac',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11200,'New York State Independence Party',33,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Our Mission\r\n\r\n    * To elevate the voters of New York State to their rightful place as the sovereign rulers of the state, reducing the office holders to the servants of the people they were intended to be;\r\n\r\n    * To create a statewide political party committed to the elimination of the electoral advantages of incumbency and the creation of a level playing field for the candidates of all political parties;\r\n\r\n    * To restore fiscally responsible government, where the state budgets to spend only what the voters are willing to pay in taxes;\r\n\r\n    * To create a political party committed to the highest standards of quality in every aspect of the party -- representation, organization, campaigning, elections, fund raising, and participation;\r\n\r\n    * To encourage voter participation and involvement, both in the party itself and in the political process as a whole. \r\n\r\n    The quality of a democracy is measured by the quality of participation by ordinary citizens. Democratic values and attitudes are learned through participation, and the highest calling of a citizen is to serve his or her fellow citizens in office as a position of trust, enjoying the bonds of affection with the voters for their willingness to sacrifice through public service. Our political party is committed to every aspect of this participation, whether in our party or in other political parties and organizations. We are thereby committed to choice in elections, volunteerism within the parties, and citizens who are willing to serve us as elected officials. We are equally committed to honest debate, the forthright presentation of our values, and respect for the rights of everyone.','Org,PoliticalParty',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11201,'Doug Jones for US Senate',24,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11202,'Ralph Neas for Congress 2000',28,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,IndividualCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11203,'Rhode Island PAC',16,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising,OtherCampaignCommittee',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00'