urgery at the time, which restricted radiosurgery to the treatment of intracranial tumors.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11998,'Achaogen',8,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Achaogen is developing next-generation aminoglycosides: âneoglycosidesââ a designation that reflects their lineage and conveys their novelty.  Achaogenâs lead neoglycosides display broad-spectrum activity against many resistant bacteria that cause systemic infections, including K. pneumoniae, E. coli and MRSA.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11999,'Seneca Global Advisors',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12000,'Acorda Therapeutics',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Acorda TherapeuticsÂ® was established in March 1995 to develop therapies that restore neurological function to people with spinal cord injury (SCI), multiple sclerosis (MS) and related conditions of the nervous system.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12001,'Rhodes College',14,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,School',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12002,'Hadassah',8,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:49:\"The Women\'s Zionist Organization of America, Inc.\";}','Org','The Women\'s Zionist Organization of America, Inc.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12003,'American College of Rheumatology',32,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,School',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12004,'KOS Pharmaceuticals',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12005,'NitroMed Inc',12,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','