','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12048,'Actinium Pharmaceuticals',24,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','By utilizing the proven targeting capabilities of monoclonal antibodies (mAbs), API is able to deliver its proprietary isotopes directly to tumor cells. This targeted therapy delivers a powerful focused energy to the selected cell, disrupting its internal machinery and thereby eliminating it from the patientâs body while sparing nearby healthy cells.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12049,'Sanofi-Aventis',14,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,PublicCompany,PrivateCompany',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12050,'Alexion Pharmaceuticals',23,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,PublicCompany',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12051,'AdMeTech Foundation',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Approach:\r\nTo develop accurate and affordable diagnostic tools for early detection and treatment through ground-breaking programs in research and education.\r\n\r\nVision:\r\nTo eliminate blind prostate cancer care and create image-guided, precisely-targeted, minimally-invasive biopsy and treatment, which can be performed in outpatient clinics with drastically reduced discomfort, complications, and costs.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12052,'Milbank, Tweed, Hadley & McCloy LLP',35,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,LawFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12053,'Enloe Medical Center',20,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12054,'Cancer Treatment Centers of America',35,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28