r\nManage grassroots-oriented campaigns\r\nRun successfully for elected office\r\nFormulate policy as elected officials or key staff members\r\nSucceed in the competitive field of broadcast media\r\nCommunicate a conservative message using the media\r\n\r\nThe Institute offers 41 educational programs and a top-notch intern program. The Institute also provides an Employment Placement Service to help place conservatives in public policy positions and in the broadcast media, at no cost to employers or jobseekers.\r\n\r\nLeadership Institute graduates work in all areas of public policy, government, and the news media. At least 555 current state legislators are Leadership Institute graduates and at least 91 graduates of LIâs Broadcast Journalism School currently work in television news.\r\n\r\nThe Leadership Institute is the center of conservative activist training. No other organization provides more training to conservative activists each year.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12069,'Young Conservatives',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12070,'A Voice for All',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12071,'House  Government Reform Committee',34,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12072,'Children\'s Specialized Hospital',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12073,'Council of New Jersey Teaching Hospitals',40,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12074,'Ogilvy Government Relations',27,NULL,'','Org','','Org,PublicRelationsFirm,Business,LobbyingFirm,Pac',0,'2010-1