,'Moffett Group',13,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','The Moffett Group is somewhat unique in Washington. Chaired by a highly-respected former member of the House who was named Top Legislator by the Consumer Federation of America, we provide comprehensive political strategies for our clients to ensure that their messages are well received at the highest levels here in DC. We are committed to working with clients whose stories we like; we enjoy communicating these stories to critical policymakers in both houses of Congress and the Obama Administration. We specialize not only in direct intervention and advocacy for both our private sector and non-profit clients, but in maximizing impact for those clients by creating and strengthening coalitions of private and public players.\r\n\r\nOur chairman, former Representative Anthony \"Toby\" Moffett, brings a variety of experiences and capabilities to our efforts that few, if any, other advocates in Washington share. Aside from serving four terms as an elected member Congress, Mr. Moffett has been a vice president of a Fortune 100 company, a teacher at various institutions of higher learning, a TV anchor and producer, one of the original \"Nader\'s Raiders\" who fought hard to reduce government corruption, and much more.','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12500,'People for the American Way',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Philanthropy',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12501,'US Attorney\'s Office Washington DC',34,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12502,'Podesta Mattoon',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12503,'BellSouth Corp',14,NULL,'a:3:{i:0;s:0:\"\";i:1;s:9:\"BellSouth\";i:2;s:34:\"Bell South Telecomm