rm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12631,'SZD Wicker',10,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12632,'Univ Health Systems/Eastern Carolina',36,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12633,'AmerisourceBergen Corp',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12634,'Harshman Consulting',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12635,'Ension Inc',10,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12636,'McKinsey & Company',18,NULL,'','Org','Marvin Bower founded McKinsey & Co. in 1926. This privately held international management consulting company has 90 offices located in 51 countries. Ian Davis is managing director.','Org,Business,PrivateCompany',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-04-07 06:21:59',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12637,'Intersystems Corp',17,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12638,'House Commerce Subcommittee on Telecommunications & Finance',59,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12639,'Boston Basketball Partners',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Boston Basketball Partners purchased the Boston Celtics on Dec. 31, 2002, Mr. Lacob joins managing partners H. Irving Grousbeck, Wyc Grousbeck, and Stephen Pagliuca, who together form the first local ownership of the Celtics since Walter Brown\'s death in 1964.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12640,'American University of Paris',28,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','We aim to provide the finest American undergraduate and graduate programs to students from all national, linguistic, and educational backgrounds, and to take our place as a renowned global center for innovative interdisciplinary research.','Org,School',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12641,'Turner Broadcasting System',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12642,'Schiff Hardin LLP',17,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','As a general practice law firm, Schiff Hardin has strong capabilities in most legal disciplines and a total dedication to client service. We have helped shape the law in a number of cases in the U.S. Supreme Court, Federal Circuit Courts of Appeal, and state appellate courts, including landmark decisions in the fields of utility rate jurisdiction, intellectual property, product liability, animal law, class actions, and many other areas.','Org,LawFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12643,'Senate Subcommittee on Public Health & Safety',45,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12644,'Ball Janik LLP',14,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','During the past two decades, the firm has expanded into Washington, DC, Central Oregon, and Seattle, Washington offices and has grown to approximately 55 lawyers, 7 government affairs specialists, and 69 professional and support staff members. Ball Janik LLP actively practices in a wide range of legal fields, excluding criminal and domestic relations law. Conscious of its roots as a small group of like-minded lawyers and staff, Ball Janik LLP has consciously carried forward the informality and collegiality of its early days. Doors are open. Discussions are encouraged. Decisions are reached on a consensus basis. Lasting client relationships are valued as the ultimate compliment to the firm\'s work. Each person working at Ball Janik LLP understands that in all of our efforts, we are continually working to advance our clients\' interests.','Org,LawFirm,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12645,'Senate Majority Leader',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12646,'San Francisco Ballet',20,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,MembershipOrg,Cultural',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12647,'US Saudi Arabian Business Council',33,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12648,'Chief Executives Club of Boston',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12649,'http://www.waggeneredstrom.com/',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12650,'Wang Laboratories, Inc.',23,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12651,'TechNet',7,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12652,'BL Evans & Associates',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12653,'American Assn of Exporters & Importers',38,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Our broad economic base includes manufacturers, distributors, retailers and service providers. We promote fair and open trade policy an