yesterday.\r\n\r\nThe firm, Copeland Lowery Jacquez Denton & White, has been a major player on K Street, particularly in winning narrow appropriations, known as earmarks, for military contractors, municipalities and others. Federal investigators last month subpoenaed many of the firm\'s clients to learn more about the relationship between Lewis and former representative Bill Lowery (R-Calif.), a partner in the firm since 1993 who is a friend and financial supporter of his.','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12704,'County of Riverside, CA',23,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12705,'House Appropriations Subcommittee on Defense',44,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12706,'House Appropriations Subcommittee on Energy & Water Development',63,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12707,'Nelson, Mullins et al',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Clients of Nelson Mullins benefit from our national reputation in a range of legal areas and our leadership among peers. Our clients interact with experienced lawyers who can draw on the collective knowledge of more than 400 Nelson Mullins attorneys as well as take advantage of the most current technologies available. Our more than 100 years in the legal profession provide clients an established Firm with a history both in the courtroom and the boardroom. With offices in Atlanta, Boston, Tallahassee, Washington DC, and throughout the Carolinas, Nelson Mullins offers solutions that complement our clientsâ values and objectives.','Org,LawFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12708,'Ron Klink & Associates',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','In order to provide the highest level of attention to each client, our business policy is to maintain only the number of clients that we can comfortably serve. This ensures that each client is always working with a Principal of the firm. We devote the necessary time and resources to arduously develop and implement a successful strategy to get the job done for each client.','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12709,'QLogic Corporation',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12710,'House Select Children, Youth & Families Committee',49,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12711,'Ryan, MacKinnon et al',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,LobbyingFirm,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12712,'CTIA',4,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','As an organization, we represent service providers, manufacturers, wireless data and internet companies, as well as other contributors to the wireless universe. CTIA advocates on their behalf before the Executive Branch, the Federal Communications Commission, Congress, and state regulatory and legislative bodies.','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12713,'Senate Judiciary Subcommittee on Constitution',45,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12714,'New Democratic Network',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Just a block from the White House, NDN has a significant media presence, deep relationships with elected officials and is a major forum for events and cutting-edge thought-leaders.  In recent years NDN has become a leader economic and globalization issues; clean technology and the creation of a low-carbon economy; demographic changes, including the study of the growing importance of Hispanics, the Millennial Generation and the exurbs; U.S.-Latin American relations and comprehensive immigration reform; and the advocacy and use of the latest new tools and media.','Org,ThinkTank',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-04-22 01:32:29',NULL,0,'deleted',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12715,'Espeed Inc.',11,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12716,'BUREAU OF ECONOMIC, ENERGY, AND BUSINESS AFFAIRS',48,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Bureau\'s work lies at the critical nexus of economic prosperity and national security. As the single point where international economic policy tools and threads converge, we help promote a coherent economic policy across the U.S. Government.','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12717,'Organization for Economic Cooperation & Development',51,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','The Organisation provides a setting where governments compare policy experiences, seek answers to common problems, identify good practice and coordinate domestic and international policies.\r\nSupport sustainable economic growth\r\nBoost employment\r\nRaise living standards\r\nMaintain financial stability\r\nAssist other countries\' economic development\r\nContribute to growth in world trade','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12718,'Larson, Stewart et al',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12719,'Larson, Dodd et al',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12720,'Arent, Fox et al',16,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','The five fo