Care Development Corporation, New York City AIDS Fund, New York Society for Health Planning, and New York Cares.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14127,'American Coalition for Clean Coal Electricity (ACCCE)',53,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','ACCCE believes that the robust utilization of coal â Americaâs most abundant energy resource â is essential to providing affordable, reliable electricity for millions of U.S. consumers and a growing domestic economy. Further, ACCCE is committed to continued and enhanced U.S. leadership in developing and deploying new, advanced clean coal technologies that protect and improve the environment.','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14128,'American Society of Association Executives (ASAE)',49,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','ASAE (American Society of Association Executives) is the membership organization and voice of the association profession. Founded in 1920, ASAE now has more than 22,000 association CEOs, staff professionals, industry partners, and consultant members.','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14129,'George Bush Presidential Library Foundation',43,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','The George Bush Presidential Library Center is a dynamic learning environment dedicated to the idea that public service is a noble calling and to preserving the historic legacy of President George Bush. Comprised of the George Bush Presidential Library and Museum, the George Bush School of Government and Public Service, and the George Bush Presidential Library Foundation, the Center sits on 90 acres of rolling Texas terrain where a timeless creed of duty and honor not only endures, but thrives. More than that, it is a place of possibilities - where students can become leaders, teachers can become scholars, researchers can become historians, and visitors can renew their pride in America.\r\n\r\nThe George Bush Presidential Library Center sponsors an exciting array of exhibits, lectures, conferences, and special events. The Center\'s focus is to bring to public attention prominent scholars, practitioners, and artists in a format that invites public participation and exposure to leading scholarly, policy, and cultural events.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14130,'Brunswick Group',15,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Brunswick is a corporate communications partnership. We provide informed advice at a senior level to businesses and other organizations around the world, helping them to address critical communications challenges that may affect their valuation, reputation or ability to achieve their ambitions.\r\n\r\nWorldwide, we are one firm, a private partnership that has grown organically, person-by-person, from three Partners in one office in 1987 to over 80 Partners and 50 Directors in 15 offices around the world today. In total, we are more than 470 people. Our predominance of senior professionals from a range of industry backgrounds gives us a major competitive advantage and our clients a significant benefit. As a result, we are ranked in first position in the league tables for M&A communications advisers in both Europe and North America.\r\n\r\nOur clients often face demanding issues and audiences. They look to us for a team of highly experienced and dedicated communications specialists working together as one firm. We advise more than 180 retained clients, including large multinationals, small private firms and voluntary bodies. Half our clients have been with us for more than five years; a fifth for more than ten years. We aim to deliver a result that is visible, valuable and earns the respect of our clients and their subsequent recommendation.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14131,'Office of the United States Trade Representative',48,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:34:\"United States Trade Representative\";}','Org','The Office of the U.S. Trade Representative (USTR) is responsible for developing and coordinating U.S. international trade, commodity, and direct investment policy, and overseeing negotiations with other countries. The head of USTR is the U.S. Trade Representative, a Cabinet member who serves as the presidentâs principal trade advisor, negotiator, and spokesperson on trade issues.','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-04-07 07:21:24',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14132,'Edison Electric Institute',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14133,'Aerospace Industries Association of America',43,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14134,'Air Conditioning Contractors of America',39,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14135,'Air-Conditioning, Heating and Refrigeration Institute',53,NULL,'a:2:{i:0;s:0:\"\";i:1;s:44:\"Air-Conditioning and Refrigeration Institute\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-04-12 18:12:29',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14136,'Air Movement and Control Association International',50,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14137,'Transamerica Corporation Political Action Committee (Transpac)',62,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14138,'American Beverage Association',29,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14139,'American Bus Association',24,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org