 people who make decisions that can change the political and regulatory environment that can result in a more favorable business environment for you.\r\n \r\nOur efforts are keenly focused on the political realities that may affect your operation and the unique requirements of each client. The simple truth is that the fortunes of both public and private enterprises often rise or fall on the strength of the political skill brought to the table. Restrictive governmental regulations can become major roadblocks â if not immovable boulders in your path â and thatâs when savvy bipartisan lobbyists with proven results can make the difference.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14306,'Marrano/Marc Equity Corp.',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','With headquarters in West Seneca, Marrano has been the most successful home builder in Western New York for over a half-century. Building homes is our only business. We build single family residential homes, townhomes and patio homes throughout the Metropolitan Buffalo area, from entry level to luxury homes. By taking a personal approach to every customer, we have earned a pristine reputation for quality, value and service that is unmatched in Western New York.\r\n\r\nSome quick facts about Marrano\r\n\r\n    * Since 1986, Marrano has been Western New York\'s number one home builder in terms of sales volume.\r\n    * We are listed among the top 300 home builders in the United States and among the Buffalo area\'s top 100 privately held companies.\r\n    * In 2003, one out of four new home buyers in Western New York built with Marrano.\r\n    * We will soon reach 15,000 homes built by Marrano during our long history in the area.\r\n    * We think these numbers speak for themselves. Marrano is the best choice for building a new home in Western New York.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14307,'West Pharmaceutical Services',28,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14308,'Tramco, Inc.',12,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14309,'Kansas World Trade Center',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14310,'World Trade Counil of Wichita',29,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14311,'Ligocyte Pharmaceuticals',24,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14312,'Southern Peaks Ltd.',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14313,'Transatlantic Business Dialogue',31,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14314,'Constar International',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14315,'The World Affairs Council of Philadelphia, PA',45,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14316,'Amway',5,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14317,'U.S.-Korea Business Council',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14318,'Michigan Business Leadership Council',36,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,MembershipOrg',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NUL