e Covanta Energy Corporation, Veolia ES Waste-to-Energy, Inc., and Wheelabrator Technologies Inc., as well as 25 municipalities that are served by waste-to-energy plants and other associate members that work in the municipal waste management and energy fields.','Org,MembershipOrg,IndustryTrade',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14496,'Marakon Associates',18,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14497,'Eyepac Political Action Committee for American Society of Cataract and Refractive Surgery',89,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14498,'Axa Equitable Life Insurance Company Political Action Committee (Axa Equitable PAC)',83,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14499,'Financial Leasing Services',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14500,'San Francisco Commission on the Environment',43,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14501,'Natural Blue Resources',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14502,'U.S. Chamber of Commerce National Chamber Litigation Center (NCLC)',66,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','NCLC provides litigation support and advocates on legal and regulatory issues on behalf of the U.S. Chamber and other organizations to challenge anti-business laws.','Org,MembershipOrg,LobbyingFirm',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14503,'Committee For Justice',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','What is the Committee for Justice?\r\n\r\nThe Committee for Justice exists to restore the judiciary to its proper role under the law. CFJ is a leading national voice on judicial issues, using television, radio, and print advertisements to inform the public about judicial confirmation controversies. In addition, the CFJ is an opinion leader for state and national media. CFJ is also an information clearinghouse, through its website and reports, and a communications hub for federal officials and state activists.','Org,MembershipOrg,ThinkTank',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14504,'American Association of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgeons Political Action Committee',82,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14505,'Americans for Republican Leadership PAC',39,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14506,'Clark-Fpg PAC of Clark',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14507,'American Federation of State County & Municipal Employees  P E O P L E',70,NULL,'a:2:{i:0;s:0:\"\";i:1;s:59:\"American Federation of State County and Municipal Employees\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-04-04 21:39:02',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14508,'American College of Cardiology Political Action Committee',57,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14509,'Dcdc Non - Federal #3',21,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14510,'Moborg. Inc',11,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 0