vels. Greening Earth Society provides sound information about CO2 and fossil fuels to educators, students, business and media representatives, community leaders and policymakers.  Information is provided to the public through the biweekly World Climate Report, the annual State of the Climate Report, the video \"The Greening of Planet Earth\" and \"The Greening of Planet Earth Continues\" and this Web site. By doing this, we enable our citizens to make decisions that benefit both humankind and the planet.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14630,'Western Fuels Association',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14631,'Knight Capital Group, Inc. Good Government Fund',47,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14632,'Stifel, Nicolaus & Company',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14633,'RBS Securities',14,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',39595,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14634,'Cantor Fitzgerald',17,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14635,'City of Cambridge',17,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,GovernmentBody',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14636,'Banking Law Journal',19,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14637,'CUREPAC',7,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,PoliticalFundraising',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14638,'Senior Advisory Group to the Director of National Inte