NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14649,'Ventas',6,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14650,'Last Software',13,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','Created SketchUp 3D modelling software.  @Last Software was acquired by Google in 2006','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14651,'3VR Security',12,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','3VR Security, Inc., was founded in 2002 by a team of former Inktomi, USWeb and TiVo executives. In the wake of 9/11, their vision was to create a product that would allow for the mining of video data to stop crimes and protect lives.\r\n\r\nTheir idea was to use search, the same technology that transformed the Internet, to make sense of the billions of hours of video data accumulated by governments, businesses, and law enforcement agencies.\r\n\r\n3VR now delivers a full line of searchable video management products that take advantage of advanced video analytics, operate on an open platform for integration, and provide the ability to dramatically reduce threats from fraud and criminal activity.\r\n\r\nThese products are used by the worldâs leading banks, retailers, and public institutions to stop losses from fraud and protect the safety and rights of the innocent.','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14652,'Cornwall Alliance for the Stewardship of Creation',49,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:49:\"Cornwall Alliance for the Stewardship of Creation\";}','Org','The Cornwall Alliance is a coalition of clergy, theologians, religious leaders, scientists, academics, and policy experts committed to bringing a balanced Biblical view of stewardship to the critical issues of environment and development. The Cornwall Alliance fully supports the principles espoused in the Cornwall Declaration on Environmental Stewardship, and is seeking to promote those principles in the discussion of various public policy issues including population and poverty, food, energy, water, endangered species, habitat, and other related topics.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14653,'Oakton Community College',24,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,School',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14654,'Center for the new Europe',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"CNE\";}','Org','The Centre for the New Europe AISBL is a non-profit, non-partisan research foundation based in Brussels. CNE has a unique modus operandi, reflecting the EU itself. Our HQ is in Brussels, but we have a network of Fellows based across the Member States, who work from both their own country and in Brussels.\r\n\r\nOver the years, CNE has published dozens of books, thousands of newspaper and magazine articles, and regularly hosts EU Commission staffers, Members of the European Parliament and key journalists at luncheon and dinner discussions. Our role is to draw attention to new research and new perspectives and to give policymakers and journalists time to pause and reflect on the big picture. At our luncheon and dinner events, we encourage open debate and frank discussion on European public policy.\r\n\r\nCNE is named for the \"New Europe\" now being born through the European Union\'s daring, historic experiment to unite some 500 million Europeans in peace and freedom. As an active member of civil society, the Centre sees itself as part of that grand ambition to create a free, prosperous and peaceful Europe.\r\n\r\nEvery enterprise is guided by a view of the world, a philosophy. Our philosophy goes under many banners: \"European liberal,\" \"pro-market,\" \"individualist,\" \"progressive\" and many others. We call ourselves simply \"Liberal.\"\r\n\r\nWe find that support for liberal ideas--free trade, social tolerance, economic liberty--extends far beyond Europe\'s Liberal parties. Therefore, we back no party or programme. We find that liberalism has friends and enemies in every party. We hope to unite its friends and persuade its enemies.','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14655,'Europe Online Networks',22,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14656,'Walt Disney Television Unit',27,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14657,'Center for Capital Markets Competitiveness',42,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14658,'Swiss Re',8,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14659,'Zurich Financial Services',25,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14660,'GlobalNet Venture Partners',26,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14661,'LeHigh University Endowment Fund',32,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,NonProfit',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14662,'Citigroup Global Markets, Inc.',30,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',8,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14663,'Penson GHCO',11,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14664,'Newedge Group',13,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',0,'2010-10-15 00:00:00','2011-03-16 01:28:49',NULL,0,'active',NULL,NULL,NULL),(14665,'Prudential Bache Commodities LLC',32,NULL,'a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}','Org','','Org,Business',75,